        "content": "## 1 — AI TRADE INTELLIGENCE\nWebhook → normalize → HS code → Comtrade → market / matching / risk models → Compliance RAG → aggregate score → store → respond.\n**Purple = AI/ML** · ML models run externally (Python/FastAPI).",
