    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 — TRADE + CRYPTO ESCROW\nBuyer accepts → fetch counterparty → trade service → smart contract creates USDC escrow (EVM TESTNET) → funds locked → store contract.\n**Green = Escrow** · escrow rules enforced by the smart contract, not n8n.",
