    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 — SHIPMENT VERIFICATION + SETTLEMENT\nSchedule → active escrows → shipment tracking API → normalize milestone → store → fetch conditions → IF all met: smart contract releases escrow + trade COMPLETED; else escrow stays LOCKED.\n**Yellow = Shipment / Dark green = Settlement** · smart contract performs final release.",
        "height": 312,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ccb82a73-52e6-462b-baa0-cb81931e43f4",
